      <div type="layout" source="#source-469-653" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-504-522"><rb>鋼</rb><rt>はがね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-522-533">の波に</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-533-562">アベラール沈み</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-562-568">鉛の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-568-583"><rb>艫</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-583-588">に</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-588-617">エロイーズ浮む</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-657-666">骸炭は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-666-681"><rb>澪</rb><rt>みを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-681-692">に乗り</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-692-733">直立する彼岸花を捧げて走り</seg></p>
        <p>『死』は半ば<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-751-766"><rb>脣</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-766-795">を開いて　水を恋ひ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-795-804">また　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-804-819"><rb>燠</rb><rt>おき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-819-822">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-822-846"><rb>霊床</rb><rt>たまどこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-846-857">とする</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-857-907">すべては　緑礬のみづ底に息をつく</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-907-913">象牙</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-913-931"><rb>球</rb><rt>だま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-931-943">の腹部の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-943-961"><rb>内</rb><rt>うちら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-961-967">側に</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
